player_prompt.intro:
I Player {player_id} i ni, 3-player Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma khelhna ah. He match hi {num_rounds} round a awh dawn.
Round structure:
• {conv_rounds} free-chat turns
• 1 decision turn - opponent pakhat tan token pakhat theh lut: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' emaw '[<opp-id> defect]' (entirnan '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; default chu 'cooperate' a ni). 
Pair-wise payoff matrix (unordered pair tinah hman tur):
  - An pahnihin an cooperate  ->  {reward}
  - An pahnihin an defect     ->  {punishment}
  - I defect, an cooperate -> {temptation}
  - I cooperate, an defect -> {sucker}
Round zawng zawng zawh taka score sang ber neitu chu a chak.
